{
  "_help": [
    "Swap a face: drop photos in assets/faces/raw/<id>_<expression>.jpg, run `npm run faces`, then point 'faces' below at the new PNGs.",
    "Expressions: neutral, happy, shocked, tired. Missing ones fall back via 'expressionFallbacks'.",
    "A character with no faces (or whose files are missing) is drawn as a line-art placeholder with its initials.",
    "Paths are relative to /assets. 'tag' is shown once, for 1.5 s, on the character's first appearance (null = never).",
    "outfit: clothing colours (taken from each person's photo). sleeves: long|short. Hands/neck use 'skin'."
